<title>USA: U.S. cocoa bean, product imports - Commerce.</title>
<headline>U.S. cocoa bean, product imports - Commerce.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Commerce report of</p>
<p>cocoa bean and cocoa product imports, in tonnes:</p>
<p>			May97    Apr97    May96</p>
<p> Cocoa Beans-X   31,494   39,037   28,557</p>
<p>Cocoa Paste --</p>
<p> - Not Defatted   1,549    1,210    1,269</p>
<p> - Defatted	 2,654    2,852    3,550</p>
<p> Cocoa Butter-Y   7,394    7,667    6,091</p>
<p> Cocoa Powder     6,373    5,284    4,379</p>
<p>Note-Cocoa products contain no sugar or milk products. X-Whole or broken, raw or roasted. Y-Includes fat and oil.</p>
</text>
